sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Route
    participant Auth_Middleware
    participant Controller
    participant Service

    Client->>+Route: GET /profile
    Route->>+Auth_Middleware: Validate
    Note over Auth_Middleware: 🔐 Authentication&#58; JWT token verify করা হচ্ছে
    Note over Auth_Middleware: Roles&#58; USER_ROLES.POSTER, USER_ROLES.TASKER, USER_ROLES.SUPER_ADMIN
    Auth_Middleware->>-Route: Valid ✓
    Route->>+Controller: UserController.getUserProfile
    Controller->>+Service: UserService.getUserProfileFromDB()
    Service->>-Controller: result
    Controller->>-Route: StatusCodes.OK - Profile data retrieved successfully
    Route-->>Client: Response
    Note over Client: ✅ Profile data retrieved successfully
